Agreement provisions governing quantitative limits for steel products trade.

```catala
declaration scope MyTradeLimitScope:
  input initial_limit content integer
  input start_date content date
  input end_date content date
  output adjusted_limit content integer
  output carryover_amount content integer
```

Deduction of quantitative limits based on the period from 1.1.2005 until the agreement's entry into force.

```catala
scope MyTradeLimitScope:
  date round down
  definition adjusted_limit equals initial_limit - (100 * (end_date - start_date) / 365)
  definition carryover_amount equals initial_limit * 10
```

Carryover of unused quantitative limits to the following calendar year is authorized up to 10% of the relevant limit.